@title Wiring: an export with nothing to do is a yellow triangle on the job
@area Reports
# T5: a new project has no wires. The Wire-it export says so with a yellow hollow triangle instead of a yellow toast.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "Export the Wire-it list"
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Warning: No wires to run yet"
shot nothing-to-run
check_layout
click_text "Warning: No wires to run yet" Button
wait 6
expect "Dismiss"
shot nothing-to-run-popover
check_layout
click_text Dismiss Button
wait 6
expect_not "Warning: No wires to run yet"
